{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t​海關在機場偵破一宗涉及入境旅客的販毒案件，檢獲約6公斤懷疑可卡因，市值約360萬元。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n一名22歲菲律賓女旅客昨日從柬埔寨金邊飛抵本港，海關在她的寄艙行李箱內發現懷疑可卡因，女子隨即被拘捕。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n被捕女子已被控一項販運危險藥物罪，案件明日在西九龍裁判法院提堂。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯：任順熙\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T00:47:49.841545+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":135,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-01T07:53:54+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T03:18:43.673462+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T00:42:10.828602+00:00","content_hash":"f29a4e17f2c15929cc9397526e0e453a45eb50ddea9be64426d34d6e97f6f2ad","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}